# Gateway Focus 27 — "The Park / Reception Center" — ~33 min — F10 theta base -> F27 high-carrier theta hold -> gentle return
# Goal: Monroe-style journey to Focus 27, "The Park": a peaceful, creative waystation.
#       Build the Focus-10 theta/delta base, transition up into the F27 high-carrier
#       theta set, dwell in a long warm welcoming hold, then a gentle multi-minute return.
# Driver: BINAURAL — HEADPHONES REQUIRED (true L/R binaural; carrier vs freq_r).
#         beat = freq_r - carrier, held FIXED per layer (guidelines 5a: freq_r is NOT
#         interpolatable). Layers are introduced/removed by fading channel VOLUME in/out.
#
# Monroe patent upgrade (US 5,356,368): + phased PINK-NOISE bed (ch14, wave 5, 6 s L<->R
#   pan LFO, -18 dB under the theta beats) and the dominant 200[4.0] theta layer SEPTON-
#   stacked into 3 detuned carriers (200/204/208 vs 204/208/212 -> 4 Hz binaural+monaural,
#   speaker-robust) on ch11-13. Signature F27 carriers (50/400/503/600/750/900) UNCHANGED.
#   See reports/session_research/monroe_patents_guide.md.
#
# Measured layer map (carrier[beat Hz], from gateway_focus_construction_guide.md):
#   F10 base (build only): 100[1.5] delta · 200[4.0] · 250[4.0] · 300[4.0] theta
#   F27 signature (hold):  50[0.8] sub-delta · 400[4.0] · 503[4.2] · 600[4.0] · 750[4.0] · 900[4.0]
#   All F27 beats <= 4.2 Hz -> high-carrier theta + one sub-delta anchor.
#
# Channel map (one channel per layer, pan 0, sine):
#   ch1 100/101.5 (1.5)  ch3 250/254 (4.0)  ch4 300/304 (4.0)                      [F10 base]
#   ch11 200/204  ch12 204/208  ch13 208/212  (4.0 SEPTON, replaces old ch2 200)   [F10 base]
#   ch5 50/50.8 (0.8)    ch6 400/404 (4.0)  ch7 503/507.2 (4.2)                     [F27]
#   ch8 600/604 (4.0)    ch9 750/754 (4.0)  ch10 900/904 (4.0)                      [F27]
#   ch14 pink-noise bed (wave 5, pan LFO 6 s, -18 dB)                              [Monroe bed]
#
# LED (guidelines 4): flicker held at a SAFE 4 Hz theta the WHOLE session (never > 12 Hz);
#   warm amber only (no saturated-red strobe, no red<->blue), dim (<= 28%), ramp-in 15 s,
#   gentle breathing brightness LFO, multi-minute fade-out. Every F27 beat is <= 4.2 Hz so
#   the 4 Hz light is fully in-band. Carriers 50..900 Hz (< 1000); offsets <= 4.2 Hz (< 35).
#
# Ramp convention = animate-on-start (5a): the > prefix sits on the row where a segment
# BEGINS; its value is the start; the target is the next same-channel/field row over the gap.

# --- Prep / fade-in (00:00-03:00): a calm 100[1.5] delta tone; vol + light fade in ---
0 4 50 >0 255 100 0 15   # LED 4 Hz theta, warm amber, brightness ramps 0->20% over 15 s
A 0 100 0 >0 0 1 101.5 7  # ch1 100[1.5] delta: vol fades 0->55 over 60 s; sine
A 0 200 ~-100:100:6000 >0 0 14 0 5   # pink bed ch14: 6 s L<->R pan, vol fades 0->8 over 60 s (wave 5)
S 3000 default 10 "Settle in and let the body grow heavy. We will begin drifting inward together."
15000 4 50 20 255 100 0 15   # brightness reaches 20% (ramp-in >=15 s done)
30000 4 50 ~12:25:12000 255 100 0 15   # gentle breathing LFO: brightness sine 12<->25% over 12 s
A 60000 100 0 55 0 1 101.5 7  # ch1 vol reaches 55; delta anchor held
A 60000 200 ~-100:100:6000 8 0 14 0 5   # pink bed reaches -18 dB steady (held through hold)

# --- Focus 10 base (03:00-08:00): add 200/250/300[4.0] theta (mind awake, body asleep) ---
A 180000 200 0 >0 0 11 204 7  # SEPTON L 200[4.0] fades in 0->18 over 60 s (replaces ch2)
A 240000 200 0 18 0 11 204 7
A 180000 204 0 >0 0 12 208 7  # SEPTON M 204[4.0] fades in 0->18
A 240000 204 0 18 0 12 208 7
A 180000 208 0 >0 0 13 212 7  # SEPTON R 208[4.0] fades in 0->18
A 240000 208 0 18 0 13 212 7
A 180000 250 0 >0 0 3 254 7  # ch3 fades in
A 240000 250 0 55 0 3 254 7
A 180000 300 0 >0 0 4 304 7  # ch4 fades in
A 240000 300 0 55 0 4 304 7
S 180000 default 10 "Entering Focus 10 now. The body is asleep, the mind clear and awake."

# --- Transition to Focus 27 (08:00-12:00): fade F10 base OUT, fade the high-carrier F27 set IN ---
A 480000 100 0 >55 0 1 101.5 7  # ch1 delta fades 55->0 over 4 min (leaving F10)
A 720000 100 0 0 0 1 101.5 7
A 480000 200 0 >18 0 11 204 7  # SEPTON L fades out 18->0 over 4 min
A 720000 200 0 0 0 11 204 7
A 480000 204 0 >18 0 12 208 7  # SEPTON M fades out
A 720000 204 0 0 0 12 208 7
A 480000 208 0 >18 0 13 212 7  # SEPTON R fades out
A 720000 208 0 0 0 13 212 7
A 480000 250 0 >55 0 3 254 7  # ch3 fades out
A 720000 250 0 0 0 3 254 7
A 480000 300 0 >55 0 4 304 7  # ch4 fades out
A 720000 300 0 0 0 4 304 7
A 480000 50 0 >0 0 5 50.8 7  # ch5 50[0.8] sub-delta anchor fades in 0->45 over 60 s
A 540000 50 0 45 0 5 50.8 7
A 480000 400 0 >0 0 6 404 7  # ch6 400[4.0] fades in 0->55
A 540000 400 0 55 0 6 404 7
A 480000 503 0 >0 0 7 507.2 7  # ch7 503[4.2] fades in 0->50
A 540000 503 0 50 0 7 507.2 7
A 480000 600 0 >0 0 8 604 7  # ch8 600[4.0] fades in 0->50
A 540000 600 0 50 0 8 604 7
A 480000 750 0 >0 0 9 754 7  # ch9 750[4.0] fades in 0->45
A 540000 750 0 45 0 9 754 7
A 480000 900 0 >0 0 10 904 7  # ch10 900[4.0] fades in 0->40
A 540000 900 0 40 0 10 904 7
S 480000 default 10 "Expanding now, rising into Focus 27 — a warm, welcoming place of your own making."

# --- The Park: warm welcoming hold (12:00-28:00 = 16 min, full F27 stack, steady) ---
720000 4 50 ~15:28:12000 255 110 0 15   # LED warmer amber, gentle breathing 15<->28%, still 4 Hz
S 720000 default 10 "You have arrived at the Park. Rest here, at ease, and let it take shape around you."
S 1200000 default 10 "There is no hurry. Explore this peaceful, creative space and simply be."

# --- Gentle return (28:00-31:00): step back down — fade the highest carriers out first ---
A 1680000 750 0 >45 0 9 754 7  # ch9 750 fades 45->0 over 3 min
A 1860000 750 0 0 0 9 754 7
A 1680000 900 0 >40 0 10 904 7  # ch10 900 fades out
A 1860000 900 0 0 0 10 904 7
1680000 4 50 ~10:20:12000 255 100 0 15   # LED dims gently, still 4 Hz theta
A 1680000 200 ~-100:100:6000 >8 0 14 0 5   # pink bed begins its slow fade-out across the return
S 1680000 default 10 "Beginning to return now, gently, carrying the calm of the Park back with you."

# --- Soft fade (31:00-33:00): remaining layers + brightness fade to zero ---
A 1860000 50 0 >45 0 5 50.8 7  # ch5 sub-delta fades 45->0 over 2 min
A 1980000 50 0 0 0 5 50.8 7
A 1860000 400 0 >55 0 6 404 7  # ch6 400 fades out
A 1980000 400 0 0 0 6 404 7
A 1860000 503 0 >50 0 7 507.2 7  # ch7 503 fades out
A 1980000 503 0 0 0 7 507.2 7
A 1860000 600 0 >50 0 8 604 7  # ch8 600 fades out
A 1980000 600 0 0 0 8 604 7
1860000 4 50 >18 255 100 0 15   # brightness fades 18->0 over 2 min (>=15 s), never abrupt
S 1860000 default 10 "Coming back to the room now, calm, clear, and refreshed."
A 1980000 200 ~-100:100:6000 0 0 14 0 5   # pink bed reaches 0 at session end
1980000 4 50 0 255 100 0 15   # end: brightness 0

S 1980000 default 20 "WAKE UP!"
S 1990000 default 40 "WAKE UP!"
S 2000000 default 50 "WAKE UP!"
S 2010000 default 60 "WAKE UP!"
